    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 8 Newpark Drive is an immaculate 3 bedroom end terraced house ideally set in a family friendly estate in the new Kinsealy Woods Development on Chapel Road just off the Malahide Road. This spacious home boasts a whole host of high-end fittings throughout and is further complimented by an A2 energy rating. \r\n\r\nThis is not one to miss!!\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly consists of an entrance hall with Dragons Den style understair storage, guest wc, living room, utility room and a large open plan kitchen / dining area with an abundance of storage space. On the first floor there are three double bedrooms, master bedroom ensuite, family bathroom and a large partially floored attic storage space accessible via a pull down ladder.\r\n\r\nKinsealy Woods is located just a short distance from both Portmarnock and Malahide Village. The M50 & M1 Motorways and Dublin Airport are easily accessible as are bus services to the city centre and Portmarnock Dart Station."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
